    "confidence": 0.6,
    "rationale": "MT's uploaded updates start aligned with the federation median (cos 1.0 in rounds 1 and 4, about 0.9 in rounds 2, 3 and 5) and then decouple. Cosine falls to 0.51 in round 7, 0.13 in round 8, and turns negative from round 10, reaching about -0.5 to -0.75 in rounds 16-19. Its norm ratio is also high for its size (median 1.33 against about 1.1-1.3 for similar-sized clients), and it rises to 1.45-1.51 late in training. The min_cos screen flags it (z=-3.0). Its local data looks normal: AUC 0.8085 (pooled 0.816), no prevalence or CITL outlier, no drift flag and no subgroup flag. That pattern points to manipulated updates rather than label noise or drift. Confidence is moderate because the cosine trend is gradual, and I could not check round-by-round values for honest clients to confirm the onset precisely.",
